<metadata>
<name>Königssee – Kühroint – Rinnkendlsteig – St. Bartholomä</name>
<desc>Up from the Königssee boat landing to the Kühroint alm, out to the Archenkanzel for the lake from above, then down the Rinnkendlsteig to St. Bartholomä and the boat back.</desc>
